---
title: "Servicios Forestales | Forestal Garuhapé SA"
description: "Servicios forestales de cosecha, transporte, biomasa, caminos, playas de acopio y consultoría para la cadena foresto-industrial."
seo:
  title: "Servicios Forestales | Forestal Garuhapé SA"
  description: "Servicios forestales de cosecha, transporte, biomasa, caminos, playas de acopio y consultoría para la cadena foresto-industrial."
  image: "/images/servicios/1470.png"
  type: article
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

<section class="py-12 pt-24 bg-slate-50" id="services">
    <div class="w-full px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-10">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Nuestros Servicios</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-700 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Soluciones forestales integrales para mejorar productividad, logística y sostenibilidad en toda la cadena foresto-industrial.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
            {% for item in todos_los_servicios %}
            <article class="group h-full bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col">
                <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
                    <img src="{{ item.imagen }}" alt="{{ item.titulo }}" class="w-full h-64 object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
                    <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200">
                            Servicio
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-20 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/25 to-transparent"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
                    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3 leading-tight">{{ item.titulo }}</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed flex-1">{{ item.descripcion }}</p>
                    <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-500 uppercase">
                        Forestal Garuhapé SA
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
